sequenceDiagram
    participant App as 🖥️ Application
    participant WAuth as 📦 WAuth
    participant DF as 🏭 DriverFactory
    participant LD as 💾 LocalDriver
    participant CE as 🔒 CryptoEngine
    participant VA as 🗄️ Vault
    participant SQLite as 💿 SQLite

    App->>WAuth: set("API_KEY", "secret", ttl=3600)
    WAuth->>DF: set_secret(key, value, ttl)
    DF->>LD: set_secret(key, value, ttl)
    LD->>CE: encrypt(value.encode())
    CE->>CE: Derive key from machine_id
    
    alt Custom Key Provided
        CE->>CE: SHA-256(custom_key)
    else Machine Key
        CE->>CE: get_machine_id()
        CE->>CE: SHA-256("wisrovi-salt-" + machine_id)
    end
    
    CE->>CE: Base64 URL-safe encode
    CE->>CE: Fernet.encrypt(data)
    CE-->>LD: encrypted_token
    LD->>VA: save(key, encrypted_token, "text", ttl)
    VA->>SQLite: INSERT OR REPLACE secret
    
    SQLite-->>VA: Commit success
    VA-->>LD: Success
    LD-->>DF: Success
    DF-->>WAuth: Success
    WAuth-->>App: None
    
    Note over App,SQLite: Complete encryption & persistence flow